---
description: "StudyHub design system: tokens and canonical UI components"
globs: apps/web/**/*.tsx, apps/web/**/*.css
alwaysApply: false
---

- Colors, spacing and radii are taken only from the tokens in apps/web/styles/tokens.css (the `--sh-*` variables).
  Hex colors and "magic" px values in components are forbidden.
- Status is conveyed by both color and text (accessibility); text contrast ≥ 4.5:1.
- Canonical components: @apps/web/components/ui/StatCard.tsx, @apps/web/components/ui/StatusBadge.tsx.
  New components are built on their pattern.
- Time is displayed in department time (Europe/Kyiv) through apps/web/lib/deadline.ts.
- Do not invent library APIs: if a method is not found in the types, check the documentation.
